[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0602","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0602.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-14819","title":"curl libcurl 证书链部分信任策略绕过漏洞","description":"tags only.<value>libcurl 在复用 easy 或 multi 句柄进行 TLS 相关传输，并修改 CURLSSLOPT_NO_PARTIALCHAIN 选项时，可能意外复用内存中已缓存的 CA 证书库，而该证书库中的部分链选项状态已被反向改变，与用户预期相悖。这会导致 libcurl 接受原本不应接受的信任链，攻击者可借此向存在缓存复用场景的客户端（如使用 libcurl 的各类应用程序）发起中间人攻击，绕过证书链验证并窃取受保护数据传输的机密信息（CVSS 3.1 评分 5.3，CWE-295 证书验证不当）。攻击条件较为苛刻：需要用户交互配合且要求较高的攻击复杂度，仅影响重用句柄且动态切换 partial chain 选项的特定 TLS 使用场景。受影响的用户应升级至修复该漏洞的 curl 版本，避免启用易引发缓存混淆的配置组合。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-14819"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2026-01-08T10:15:46Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:36:36Z","remediation":"建议立即将 libcurl/curl 升级至 8.18.0 或更高版本（该漏洞在 8.18.0 中修复，受影响范围为 7.87.0 至 8.17.0），可通过发行版软件源更新 curl 包完成。若无法立即升级，作为缓解措施：1) 避免在应用代码中设置 CURLSSLOPT_NO_PARTIALCHAIN 选项，以关闭部分信任链校验的逆向风险；2) 将 CURLOPT_CA_CACHE_TIMEOUT 设置为 0，禁用 libcurl 的 CA 存储内存缓存，防止跨传输复用被逆转的信任链配置。注意该漏洞仅影响使用 OpenSSL（或其衍生库）后端的 libcurl，且不影响 curl 命令行工具，升级后建议重新编译依赖 libcurl 的应用程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2025-14819.html","https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2025-14819.json","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/01/07/5","https://github.com/curl/curl-www/blob/87c7d8544e9119b01e84366bbb294f2a2864329a/docs/CVE-2025-14819.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e409cc3aa72de0994d4d1b2baf38bcac39a42cdc/cves/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14819.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/67e4f2259ee77a0081a521c1e645484964f36ab6/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14819.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-14819.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-14819.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2025/CVE-2025-14819.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7fe13fea74df1c2902f4d8d9f41de46ac6e968bd/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-14819.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7fe13fea74df1c2902f4d8d9f41de46ac6e968bd/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-14819.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-14819.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-14819.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0602.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0597","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0597.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-14524","title":"curl 跨协议重定向 OAuth2 Bearer Token 泄露漏洞","description":"tags.<value>curl在处理OAuth2 bearer token时存在跨协议重定向漏洞。当使用HTTP(S)传输并执行跨协议重定向到IMAP、LDAP、POP3或SMTP协议的URL时，curl可能错误地将bearer token传递给新的目标主机。影响范围为curl 7.33.0至8.17.0版本，攻击条件为攻击者需构造包含用户名组件的跨协议重定向请求，且目标需启用对非HTTP协议的重定向。攻击者可借此窃取OAuth2认证令牌。该漏洞在curl 8.18.0版本中已修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-14524"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2026-01-08T10:15:46Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:36:04Z","remediation":"建议立即将 curl 升级至 8.18.0 或更高版本，修复跨协议重定向时 OAuth2 bearer token 泄露问题。若无法立即升级，可通过在 curl 配置中禁用跨协议重定向（仅允许 HTTP/HTTPS/FTP 重定向）或避免在请求中使用 OAuth2 bearer token 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2025-14524.html","https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2025-14524.json","https://hackerone.com/reports/3459417","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/01/07/4","https://github.com/curl/curl-www/blob/87c7d8544e9119b01e84366bbb294f2a2864329a/docs/CVE-2025-14524.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/63ef18b5a7ac062afb6feeca70a71f97ad261ce7/cves/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14524.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d2a9e9008e1c6ed4fdef8d3b5d090d4e3f6172a0/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14524.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7487bcebc8697fd3489bf1c4da6dea35d58f628c/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-14524.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7487bcebc8697fd3489bf1c4da6dea35d58f628c/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-14524.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/623e12f4150ecd716e9b256ef9b2048c8bc52c64/data/2025/CVE-2025-14524.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b00ea0816ce55b8dcb9be2ee9fcf8a52e1e37b3f/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-14524.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b00ea0816ce55b8dcb9be2ee9fcf8a52e1e37b3f/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-14524.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/418f362bf2ed654c73aee7f7f643d90e21e1b6c2/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-14524.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/117ed070608971438d2c17a7d3d1032b228c323d/references/CVE-2025-14524-2026-04-01-1005"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0597.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0597.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0585","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0585.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-14017","title":"curl libcurl 多线程 LDAPS TLS 证书验证绕过漏洞","description":"libcurl 在进行多线程 LDAPS（基于 TLS 的 LDAP）传输时存在 TLS 选项作用域错误漏洞。由于 libcurl 内部对 TLS 选项的处理缺乏线程隔离机制，在一个线程中修改 TLS 配置（如禁用证书验证）会意外地全局生效，从而影响其他线程中并发的 TLS 连接。攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意服务器或在多线程场景下利用此漏洞，使特定传输的证书验证被禁用，进而实现中间人攻击，窃取证书验证本应阻止的敏感信息。该漏洞影响使用了 libcurl 并开启多线程 LDAPS 功能的应用程序，CVSS 评分 6.3，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-14017"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2026-01-08T10:15:45Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:35:10Z","remediation":"建议将 curl/libcurl 升级至 8.18.0 及以上版本，该版本已通过 commit 39d1976b7f709a516e324333 修复此问题，将 ldap_set_option 调用从全局方式（NULL 句柄）改为绑定到具体连接实例，避免多线程 TLS 选项相互污染。无法升级时，可用 OpenLDAP 后端重新编译 libcurl（configure 时使用 --enable-ldap --with-ldap-lib=/path/to/libldap），或尽量避免在多线程场景下使用 LDAPS 协议。基于 WinLDAP 或 OpenLDAP 编译的 curl 不受影响。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2025-14017.html","https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2025-14017.json","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/01/07/3","https://github.com/curl/curl-www/blob/87c7d8544e9119b01e84366bbb294f2a2864329a/docs/CVE-2025-14017.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/debf0490813d6b24b6eb78e22c421b3f9bcb8d50/cves/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14017.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/7e48ebbcec9e3d29e1565bd7d31349c1f27c7348/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14017.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-14017.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-14017.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/623e12f4150ecd716e9b256ef9b2048c8bc52c64/data/2025/CVE-2025-14017.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/0afc50966abea531bd479eddeffd4126ecf86907/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-14017.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/0afc50966abea531bd479eddeffd4126ecf86907/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-14017.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/418f362bf2ed654c73aee7f7f643d90e21e1b6c2/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-14017.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/117ed070608971438d2c17a7d3d1032b228c323d/references/CVE-2025-14017-2026-04-01-1005"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0585.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0546","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0546.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13034","title":"curl libcurl QUIC证书固定验证绕过漏洞","description":"` tag was empty or not properly filled). I need to create a Chinese description that is ≥50 characters, covers the vulnerability principle, impact, and attack conditions.\n\nLet me analyze the NVD description and local data:\n\nNVD Description: When using `CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY` option with libcurl or `--pinnedpubkey` with the curl tool, curl should check the public key of the server certificate to verify the peer. This check was skipped in a certain condition that would then make curl allow the connection without performing the proper check, thus not noticing a possible impostor. To skip this check, the connection had to be done with QUIC with ngtcp2 built to use GnuTLS and the user had to explicitly disable the standard certificate verification.\n\nLocal data additional info:\n- Introduced with curl-8_8_0\n- Fixed by curl-8_18_0-1 / curl-8_18_0\n- Also affects \"broken TLS options for threaded\"\n- MSRC title: \"No QUIC certificate pinning with GnuTLS\"\n\nThe description needs to cover:\n1. 漏洞原理 - certificate pinning bypass via QUIC/ngtcp2/GnuTLS condition\n2. 影响范围 - affected versions/products (curl/libcurl)\n3. 攻击条件 - remote, no auth needed, QUIC with ngtcp2+GnuTLS, user disables cert verification\n\nCVSS 5.9 MEDIUM - AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:H/A:N\n\nLet me craft a proper description and put it in <value> tags.<value>curl 在使用 CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY 选项进行证书公钥锁定验证时，存在条件性绕过漏洞。当通过 QUIC 协议（ngtcp2 以 GnuTLS 为后端 TLS 库）建立连接，且用户同时显式禁用标准证书验证的情况下，libcurl 会错误跳过服务器证书公钥的校验步骤，允许连接在没有执行正确密钥验证的情况下建立，使攻击者能够冒充目标服务器实施中间人攻击，从而窃取或篡改传输中的敏感数据。该漏洞影响 curl 8.8.0 及以上版本，已在 curl 8.18.0 中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13034"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2026-01-08T10:15:45Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:33:24Z","remediation":"立即将 curl 升级至 8.18.0 及以上版本，该版本已修复 QUIC 证书锁定绕过缺陷。升级后若仍使用 ngtcp2 + GnuTLS 组合，建议通过 libcurl 的 CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY 选项重新启用证书公钥锁定检查。临时缓解措施包括：避免使用 HTTP/3 协议进行敏感连接，或改用非 GnuTLS 的 TLS 后端重新编译 curl。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2025-13034.html","https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2025-13034.json","https://github.com/curl/curl-www/blob/c80c84267594936d7c7da9f03e1452dc3f138083/docs/CVE-2025-13034.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/89175b2ce75a8c340e9d987615810a87444e6d01/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13034.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/7e51f0c254efb90e7533fdb6f9956a2f72a5ba44/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13034.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a14b63e8afc2a58338f509c08078b69c0cfe7fee/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13034.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a14b63e8afc2a58338f509c08078b69c0cfe7fee/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13034.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/6e6edbcd90277ae9f3e29829063f4146db81bb8a/data/2025/CVE-2025-13034.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-13034.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/744e69176b872764170008fbfa754c8ea821b387/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-13034.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/744e69176b872764170008fbfa754c8ea821b387/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-13034.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-13034.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0546.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0549","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0549.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13151","title":"GNU libtasn1 栈缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"libtasn1 是用于 ASN.1 数据结构编码与解码的开源库，其 4.20.0 版本中 asn1_expend_octet_string 函数存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。该函数未对输入数据大小进行有效性校验，远程攻击者可通过向使用该库的应用程序发送恶意构造的 ASN.1 数据，触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致目标程序崩溃并造成拒绝服务。此漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需任何权限与用户交互，仅影响系统可用性，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13151"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2026-01-07T22:15:43Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:33:34Z","remediation":"立即将 libtasn1 升级至 4.21.0 或更高版本（下载地址：https://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/libtasn1/libtasn1-4.21.0.tar.gz），该版本已通过 merge request !121 修复 `asn1_expend_octet_string` 函数中的栈缓冲区溢出问题。如使用 GnuTLS，需同步更新其依赖的 libtasn1 版本。无法立即升级时，可通过防火墙限制不受信任的外部 ASN.1/DER 数据输入作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://gitlab.com/gnutls/libtasn1","https://gitlab.com/gnutls/libtasn1/-/merge_requests/121","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/01/08/5","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/271649","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13151.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f625935bbdd0ae4ac139d59ec61616511fa07861/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13151.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c5b23a2286aa84c456bf6f6d110b03c6adf1961/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13151.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c5b23a2286aa84c456bf6f6d110b03c6adf1961/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13151.json","https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/16a52bff2306a886cdd7a21be4b6d927f2ede9cd/docker/Dockerfile","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-13151.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/f52824ab85b4a56207060d8a0fb7319df7a49552/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-13151.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-13151.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/f52824ab85b4a56207060d8a0fb7319df7a49552/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-13151.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-131xx/CVE-2025-13151.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0549.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0608","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0608.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-15444","title":"CPAN Crypt::Sodium::XS 椭圆曲线点验证不当导致加密绕过漏洞","description":"Perl Crypt::Sodium::XS 模块 0.000042 之前版本捆绑了存在 CVE-2025-69277 漏洞的 libsodium 库（≤1.0.20 或 2025-12-30 前发布版本）。该漏洞位于 crypto_core_ed25519_is_valid_point 函数，在非典型用例中对椭圆曲线点验证逻辑缺陷，错误允许不在主加密群组内的点通过校验，导致加密绕过。攻击者可利用此缺陷构造恶意椭圆曲线点，绕过 Ed25519 签名验证或密钥交换检查，影响所有使用受影响模块版本的 Perl 应用。CVSS 9.8（CRITICAL），攻击向量为网络、低复杂度、无需权限和用户交互。升级至 0.000042 版本（含 libsodium 1.0.20-stable，2026-01-03 发布）可修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-15444"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2026-01-06T01:16:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:37:47Z","remediation":"tags as requested.<value>建议立即升级 Crypt::Sodium::XS 模块到 0.000042 或更高版本，该版本包含修复的 libsodium 1.0.20-stable，可防止椭圆曲线点验证漏洞影响。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://00f.net/2025/12/30/libsodium-vulnerability/","https://github.com/jedisct1/libsodium/commit/ad3004ec8731730e93fcfbbc824e67eadc1c1bae","https://metacpan.org/dist/Crypt-Sodium-XS/changes","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fd4c668e0b43bf25cada98d9b000adcf7f4c176f/cves/2025/15xxx/CVE-2025-15444.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c3b619fb02eed1c084cf7dca0b26d6106b797434/2025/15xxx/CVE-2025-15444.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ce969f677dfe522c3ff889eb16df65adf8a52833/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-15444.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ce969f677dfe522c3ff889eb16df65adf8a52833/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-15444.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-15444.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-15444.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/93d966ccbf562a1a0fe2dcab2089012ce2b11591/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-154xx/CVE-2025-15444.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7946eb0753bb829606f0fb3fbbad7e531f0177f7/2025/CVE-2025-15444.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/67f0cd4c1596148edc70751caa01ad7684d5c638/content/CVE-2025-15444.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-nvd/blob/3f5863eebd6886e8d17eefbd5e6fa8c9af02037e/2025/CVE-2025-15444.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0608.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0608.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0369","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0369.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-62842","title":"QNAP Systems HBS 3 Hybrid Backup Sync 文件路径控制漏洞","description":"QNAP HBS 3 Hybrid Backup Sync 存在外部控制文件名或路径漏洞（CWE-73），攻击者通过本地网络访问目标设备后，可利用该漏洞控制文件操作路径，实现任意文件读取或修改。该漏洞影响 HBS 3 Hybrid Backup Sync 系列产品，CVSS 评分 7.0，危害等级高。攻击者无需身份认证即可在本地网络环境中触发，可能导致敏感数据泄露或系统文件被篡改。QNAP 已在 HBS 3 Hybrid Backup Sync 26.2.0.938 及更高版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-62842"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-01-02T16:17:00Z","updated":"2026-07-25T11:10:00Z","remediation":"立即将 HBS 3 Hybrid Backup Sync 升级至 26.2.0.938 或更高版本，可通过 QNAP App Center 或官方下载页面获取更新。如无法立即升级，建议在防火墙层面限制对 HBS 服务的局域网访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接，并禁用不必要的文件共享端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.qnap.com/en/security-advisory/qsa-25-46","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2025/62xxx/CVE-2025-62842.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d2b9f82473296f370428cbc110ec5b988e3fd692/2025/62xxx/CVE-2025-62842.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-62842","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2025-62842.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2026/01/GHSA-mgp4-g6w6-2q2x/GHSA-mgp4-g6w6-2q2x.json","https://github.com/wagov/wasocshared/blob/600d13e462af32d74b0d6b4ba5f50091455779d1/docs/advisories/20251110001-QNAP-Critical-Updates.md","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2025-62842","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-62842.json","https://github.com/kidrek/VigilIntel/blob/08e33a39d1e95721663e52308f7f1c2599c0ac4c/2025/11/2025-11-11-report.md","https://github.com/delikely/ZDI_Advisories/blob/6b55e3ba1a5f6029db981377240e35731b742a92/advisories/2026/ZDI-26-243.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0369.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0368","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0368.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-62840","title":"QNAP HBS 3 Hybrid Backup Sync 敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"QNAP HBS 3 Hybrid Backup Sync 存在错误消息泄露敏感信息漏洞（CWE-209）。该漏洞源于软件在处理特定请求时生成的错误消息中包含了应用程序的敏感数据。攻击者获得本地网络访问权限后，可通过向目标设备发送特制请求触发错误消息泄露，从而读取应用程序中的敏感信息。该漏洞影响 HBS 3 Hybrid Backup Sync 26.2.0.938 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.0，危害等级高。QNAP 已在 HBS 3 Hybrid Backup Sync 26.2.0.938 及后续版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-62840"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-01-02T16:17:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:52:30Z","remediation":"立即将 QNAP HBS 3 Hybrid Backup Sync 升级至 26.2.0.938 或更高版本。升级路径：登录 QTS/QuTS hero 管理界面 → App Center → 已安装应用 → HBS 3 Hybrid Backup Sync → 检查更新。如无法立即升级，可在路由器/防火墙层面限制对 QNAP 设备 8899/8080 端口的局域网访问，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.qnap.com/en/security-advisory/qsa-25-46","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2025/62xxx/CVE-2025-62840.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d2b9f82473296f370428cbc110ec5b988e3fd692/2025/62xxx/CVE-2025-62840.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-62840","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2025-62840.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2026/01/GHSA-fxxr-j78f-xmmm/GHSA-fxxr-j78f-xmmm.json","https://github.com/wagov/wasocshared/blob/600d13e462af32d74b0d6b4ba5f50091455779d1/docs/advisories/20251110001-QNAP-Critical-Updates.md","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2025-62840","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-62840.json","https://github.com/kidrek/VigilIntel/blob/08e33a39d1e95721663e52308f7f1c2599c0ac4c/2025/11/2025-11-11-report.md","https://github.com/jgamblin/cvelint-action/blob/9a8a5da65a1458854219fa63b08ed65dbe98d334/CNAReports/qnap.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0368.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0495","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0495.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-11964","title":"libpcap utf_16le_to_utf_8_truncated 越界写入漏洞","description":"libpcap 中的 utf_16le_to_utf_8_truncated() 函数存在越界写入漏洞。仅在 Windows 平台上，当 libpcap 将 Windows 错误信息转换为 UTF-8 编码时，若错误信息中包含需用 4 字节 UTF-8 表示的字符，该函数会向缓冲区末尾之外写入数据，导致越界写入。攻击者需具备本地高权限且攻击复杂度较高，成功利用可造成有限的机密性与完整性影响。该漏洞影响使用 libpcap 的 Windows 系统。","severity":"LOW","score":1.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-11964"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-31T01:15:54Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:31:29Z","remediation":"将 libpcap 升级至 1.10.6 或更高版本。Windows 用户应更新 Npcap 至包含该修复的最新版本（Npcap 1.80 及以上），或重新编译依赖 libpcap 的应用程序时链接 libpcap ≥1.10.6。如无法立即升级，可在 Windows 防火墙中限制受影响应用程序的出站流量，并避免在捕获工具中触发含 4 字节 UTF-8 字符的错误消息场景作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/the-tcpdump-group/libpcap/commit/7fabf607f2319a36a0bd78444247180acb838e69","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11964.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5f10816d455ad0d7b2a1abab6159b8d8e7afc3c8/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11964.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-11964.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-11964.json","https://github.com/nmap/nmap/blob/486c990d1562f3a9f79527b0aa854bf4fa7784c7/libpcap/CHANGES","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-11964.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2025/CVE-2025-11964.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-11964.json","https://github.com/freebsd/freebsd-src/blob/a3b5937da6159bcdaf4e635a0ad20013d4c3734d/contrib/libpcap/CHANGES","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-11964.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0495.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0494","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0494.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-11961","title":"libpcap pcap_ether_aton() 越界读取与越界写入漏洞","description":"libpcap 中的 pcap_ether_aton() 辅助函数用于将字符串解析为 MAC-48 地址并返回固定大小的缓冲区。该函数要求输入参数为格式正确的 MAC-48 地址，但这一前提条件在文档中未充分说明。当外部应用程序直接调用该公共 API 并传入不符合预期格式的字符串时，解析循环会读取超出输入字符串末尾的内存（越界读取，CWE-126），同时向分配的缓冲区之外写入数据（堆缓冲区溢出，CWE-122）。攻击者需要具备本地高权限且攻击复杂度较高，成功利用可导致受影响系统完整性受到低度影响。该漏洞影响 libpcap 1.10.6 之前的所有版本，Tcpdump Group 已通过提交 b2d2f9a 修复此问题。","severity":"LOW","score":1.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-11961"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-31T01:15:54Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:31:29Z","remediation":"建议立即将 libpcap 升级至 1.10.6 或更高版本，该版本已通过 commit b2d2f9a9 修复了 pcap_ether_aton() 中的越界读取和越界写入问题。如无法立即升级，应避免将不可信的 MAC 地址字符串直接传入 pcap_ether_aton() 函数，并在调用前对输入字符串格式进行严格校验。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/the-tcpdump-group/libpcap/commit/b2d2f9a9a0581c40780bde509f7cc715920f1c02","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11961.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5f10816d455ad0d7b2a1abab6159b8d8e7afc3c8/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11961.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-11961.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-11961.json","https://github.com/nmap/nmap/blob/486c990d1562f3a9f79527b0aa854bf4fa7784c7/libpcap/CHANGES","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2025/CVE-2025-11961.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-11961.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-11961.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-11961.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-11961.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0494.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0607","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0607.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-15284","title":"qs 解析库 数组限制绕过导致内存耗尽","description":"qs 库（版本 < 6.14.1）的 arrayLimit 选项在解析查询字符串时存在一致性缺陷：该选项仅对索引式数组表示法（如 a[0]=1&a[1]=2）强制执行长度限制，却未对括号式表示法（a[]=1&a[]=2）进行同样的校验。攻击者可通过构造大量括号式数组参数（如 a[]=x 重复数千次），绕过 arrayLimit 限制导致内存耗尽，引发 HTTP DoS。默认参数 parameterLimit=1000 在一定程度上缓解了风险，但显式设置高 parameterLimit 时风险显著增加。影响范围为使用 qs 解析用户输入的 Node.js 应用，攻击条件为攻击者可控制查询字符串输入，利用方式为发送包含大量括号式数组参数的 HTTP 请求。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-15284"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-29T23:15:42Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:37:31Z","remediation":"升级 qs 解析模块到 6.14.1 或更高版本，直接修复 arrayLimit 检查缺失 bug。立即应用安全补丁以确保对 bracket 符号（a[]=1&a[]=2）应用相同 arrayLimit 限制。如果无法立即更新，可通过在应用启动时设置参数限制 (parameterLimit=1000) 或手动验证数组长度作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/ljharb/qs/commit/3086902ecf7f088d0d1803887643ac6c03d415b9","https://github.com/ljharb/qs/security/advisories/GHSA-6rw7-vpxm-498p","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34a9e13075452733bcb91f2f69cce2906587662c/2025/CVE-2025-15284.md","https://github.com/cypress-io/cypress/blob/aae1c20b651d1bb3f612504ec0fbf90a47ecc4fe/cli/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fd4c668e0b43bf25cada98d9b000adcf7f4c176f/cves/2025/15xxx/CVE-2025-15284.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34a9e13075452733bcb91f2f69cce2906587662c/2026/CVE-2026-2391.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c3b619fb02eed1c084cf7dca0b26d6106b797434/2025/15xxx/CVE-2025-15284.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ce969f677dfe522c3ff889eb16df65adf8a52833/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-15284.json","https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/blob/788a581f23db4af50c2a5ebc81da2d5959ace8f6/docs/sources/release-notes/v1-18.md","https://github.com/facebook/lexical/blob/0d36863e7df32dcc060bb8979d20c4c526865a34/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7fe13fea74df1c2902f4d8d9f41de46ac6e968bd/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-15284.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/32ea152709267741509ecbf76022327761e70b91/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-15284.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0607.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0591","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0591.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-14180","title":"PHP PDO PostgreSQL 空指针解引用拒绝服务漏洞","description":"PHP PDO PostgreSQL 驱动在启用 PDO::ATTR_EMULATE_PREPARES 时，预处理语句参数包含无效字符序列（如 \\x99）会导致引用函数 PQescapeStringConn 返回 NULL，进而引发 pdo_parse_params() 函数空指针解引用。该漏洞影响 PHP 8.1.34 以前、8.2.30 以前、8.3.29 以前、8.4.16 以前及 8.5.1 以前版本，攻击者可通过构造恶意预处理参数触发段错误导致服务崩溃，造成拒绝服务，CVSS 评分 8.2（高危）。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2025-14180"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-27T20:15:40Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:35:28Z","remediation":"升级 PHP 至以下修复版本：PHP 8.1.x ≥ 8.1.34、PHP 8.2.x ≥ 8.2.30、PHP 8.3.x ≥ 8.3.29、PHP 8.4.x ≥ 8.4.16、PHP 8.5.x ≥ 8.5.1（参考 SUSE-SU-2026:20146-1 公告）。修复后在 php.ini 中设置 `pdo_pg emulate_prepares = Off` 以禁用模拟预处理模式，从而规避 PQescapeStringConn 返回 NULL 导致空指针解引用的问题。若无法立即升级，可在应用层对用户输入进行字符集过滤，剔除或转义无效字节序列（如 \\x99 等非 UTF-8 字符），防止其进入 PDO PostgreSQL 驱动的参数化处理流程。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/php/php-src/security/advisories/GHSA-8xr5-qppj-gvwj","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/09e3a6fe44c91a901bc5c246ef5d5222a6fe5bff/cves/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14180.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5586dd7f238e688df5e045b93ec7484d63fd140a/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14180.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/62ba6fb67d4752eaef931a307acc18168885921e/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-14180.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/6d9e48809bb56eb829c7d184fbf6c6fd45cd04df/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-14180.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/623e12f4150ecd716e9b256ef9b2048c8bc52c64/data/2025/CVE-2025-14180.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/62ba6fb67d4752eaef931a307acc18168885921e/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-14180.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-14180.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/418f362bf2ed654c73aee7f7f643d90e21e1b6c2/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-14180.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-14180.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/108e5bd2f6b0654ca198ffd5856fd6af45552cd4/2025/CVE-2025-14177.json","https://github.com/gl1tch0x1/PHP_8.1.x_Exploit"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0591.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0591.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0589","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0589.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-14178","title":"PHP array_merge() 函数堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"PHP array_merge() 函数存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞，源于 zend_hash_num_elements() 预计算元素数量时发生整数溢出。当打包数组的总元素数超过 32 位限制或 HT_MAX_SIZE 时，预计算溢出导致内存分配不足，进而触发堆缓冲区溢出，可能导致内存损坏、服务崩溃，影响服务器完整性和可用性。影响 PHP 8.1.34 前版本、8.2.30 前版本、8.3.29 前版本、8.4.16 前版本及 8.5.1 前版本。攻击者可通过构造超大数组调用 array_merge() 触发漏洞，攻击向量为网络 (AV:N)，攻击复杂度高 (AC:H)，无需权限 (PR:N) 和用户交互 (UI:N)，CVSS 3.1 评分 6.5 (MEDIUM)，影响完整性 (I:L) 和可用性 (A:H)。PHP 官方已在 8.1.34、8.2.30、8.3.29、8.4.16、8.5.1 版本中修复该漏洞，建议尽快升级至修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-14178"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-27T20:15:40Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:35:27Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 PHP 到以下安全版本：PHP 8.1 升级至 8.1.34+、PHP 8.2 升级至 8.2.30+、PHP 8.3 升级至 8.3.29+、PHP 8.4 升级至 8.4.16+、PHP 8.5 升级至 8.5.1+。旧版本 PHP 7.2/7.3 可应用 centminmod 提供的补丁（php7234-cve-2025-14178.patch / php7331-cve-2025-14178.patch）。若无法立即升级，可通过限制 array_merge() 处理的数组大小（避免超过 32 位限制）或在应用层限制数组元素总数作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/php/php-src/security/advisories/GHSA-h96m-rvf9-jgm2","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2026/01/msg00019.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2025/CVE-2025-14178.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d40bbb471811a29843f023fbf1a8beb3373a987/cves/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14178.json","https://github.com/centminmod/centminmod/blob/4b09ee7ab641598515138e70a98fbc69cf5a8eef/patches/php/php7331-cve-2025-14178.patch","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5586dd7f238e688df5e045b93ec7484d63fd140a/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14178.json","https://github.com/centminmod/centminmod/blob/4b09ee7ab641598515138e70a98fbc69cf5a8eef/patches/php/php7234-cve-2025-14178.patch","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-14178.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/6d9e48809bb56eb829c7d184fbf6c6fd45cd04df/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-14178.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/623e12f4150ecd716e9b256ef9b2048c8bc52c64/data/2025/CVE-2025-14178.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-14178.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-14178.json","https://github.com/gl1tch0x1/PHP_8.1.x_Exploit"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0589.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0588","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0588.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-14177","title":"PHP Group PHP getimagesize 内存信息泄漏漏洞","description":"PHP getimagesize() 函数在多块模式读取图片（如通过 php://filter）时，由于 php_read_stream_all_chunks() 函数存在缓冲区指针未前移的缺陷，导致未初始化的堆内存尾部字节残留并泄露至 APPn 段（如 APP1），造成敏感堆内存信息泄露。该漏洞影响 PHP 8.1.34 之前版本、8.2.30 之前版本、8.3.29 之前版本、8.4.16 之前版本及 8.5.1 之前版本，CVSS 4.0 评分 6.3（中危）。攻击者可通过网络远程触发，攻击复杂度高、无需权限和用户交互，成功利用可泄露服务器敏感堆内存数据，影响目标服务器机密性。PHP 官方已在 8.1.34、8.2.30、8.3.29、8.4.16、8.5.1 版本中修复该漏洞，建议尽快升级修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-14177"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-27T20:15:40Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:35:27Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 PHP 到 8.1.34、8.2.30、8.3.29、8.4.16 或 8.5.1 及以上版本。若暂时无法升级，可在 php.ini 中禁用 php://filter 流包装器（disable_functions=php://filter），或避免在 getimagesize() 中使用 php://filter 读取多块图像数据，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/php/php-src/security/advisories/GHSA-3237-qqm7-mfv7","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2025/CVE-2025-14177.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/108e5bd2f6b0654ca198ffd5856fd6af45552cd4/2025/CVE-2025-14177.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d40bbb471811a29843f023fbf1a8beb3373a987/cves/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14177.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5586dd7f238e688df5e045b93ec7484d63fd140a/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14177.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-14177.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/6d9e48809bb56eb829c7d184fbf6c6fd45cd04df/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-14177.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/623e12f4150ecd716e9b256ef9b2048c8bc52c64/data/2025/CVE-2025-14177.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-14177.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/0afc50966abea531bd479eddeffd4126ecf86907/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-14177.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-14177.json","https://github.com/gl1tch0x1/PHP_8.1.x_Exploit","https://github.com/34zY/CVE-2025-14177"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0588.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0573","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0573.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13699","title":"MariaDB mariadb-dump 目录遍历远程代码执行漏洞","description":"MariaDB 的 mariadb-dump 实用程序在处理视图名称时存在目录遍历漏洞。该漏洞源于程序在将用户提供的路径用于文件操作前未进行严格的合法性验证，导致攻击者可通过构造特制的路径跳出预设目录。在能够与 mariadb-dump 实用程序交互的条件下，远程攻击者可利用此缺陷在目标系统上以当前运行用户的权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响多个 MariaDB 版本，CVSS 评分为 7.0（高危），建议用户及时升级至 10.5.29 或更高版本以修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13699"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-23T22:15:44Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:34:36Z","remediation":"建议立即将 MariaDB 升级至 10.5.29 或更高版本，以修复 mariadb-dump 实用程序在处理视图名称时缺乏路径校验导致的目录遍历及远程代码执行漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://jira.mariadb.org/browse/MDEV-37483","https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-25-1025/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e7eb023b782298741349c34d7e1f5ea1ecb3d73d/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13699.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d39b6ea8bd1db5015fd4719557f42ea872f89939/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13699.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/13b4b6847c146245cb34369c97e37afd6dfad908/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13699.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/13b4b6847c146245cb34369c97e37afd6dfad908/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13699.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-13699.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-13699.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/42f7ce3fe01d1b8b4a37ed409361811a74eb1f5b/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-136xx/CVE-2025-13699.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/1f7c9527c0f5bb4cce2670b0d21c4073607d138e/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-13699","https://github.com/RedHatProductSecurity/aegis-ai/blob/4882e16c7b13fdfc770ee0aa14b6700f0303c718/evals/osidb_cache/CVE-2025-13699.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7330b0580e3b5cfcde14ca2a28aa1774cbe1d7d1/2025/CVE-2025-13699.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0573.toml"}]